DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
17930::$$$message_0135_0000_0000$$$::"Oh?"[lr]::
17931::$$$message_0135_0000_0001$$$::There's no one at the end of the pier.[lr]::
17932::$$$message_0135_0000_0002$$$::I feel like that was Shinji's usual place...[lr]::
17933::$$$message_0135_0000_0003$$$::"Huh, the weather..."[lr]::
17934::$$$message_0135_0000_0004$$$::I wonder what happened.[lr]::
17935::$$$message_0135_0000_0005$$$::[se volume=60 storage=se023.wav]The weather was so good earlier, yet the sky took a turn and is now covered with thick clouds.::
17936::$$$message_0135_0001_0000$$$::"...It seems as if a typhoon is coming...[lr]::
17937::$$$message_0135_0001_0001$$$::I need to go back before it starts raining..."[lr]::
17938::$$$message_0135_0001_0002$$$::...No.[lr]::
17939::$$$message_0135_0001_0003$$$::I can't turn back now. I need to call out to Shinji if a storm is coming.::
17940::$$$message_0135_0002_0000$$$::"Hey, Shinji, are you there!?[lr]::
17941::$$$message_0135_0002_0001$$$::It's gonna start raining, the wind's already strong, you need to get back before you get swallowed up by the waves and join the seaweed club!"[lr]::
17942::$$$message_0135_0002_0002$$$::The wind is starting to become unbelievably strong.[lr]::
17943::$$$message_0135_0002_0003$$$::...No matter how you look at it, this is unnatural.[lr]::
17944::$$$message_0135_0002_0004$$$::It's almost like a cataclysm for such a storm to come the moment I came to the port...::
17945::$$$message_0135_0003_0000$$$::"What...!? The card is starting to glow...!?"::
17946::$$$message_0135_0004_0000$$$::...The time has come. Let the war between kings to conquer the Earth begin.::
17947::$$$message_0135_0004_0001$$$::You are the strongest, chosen hero, Gobatchnen.::
17948::$$$message_0135_0004_0002$$$::You've made it to the lair of the flame dragon Payapaya who's plotting to overthrow the kingdom,::
17949::$$$message_0135_0004_0003$$$::but the Sequel Curse has reset your level and all of your gear!::
17950::$$$message_0135_0004_0004$$$::Still, destiny waits for no one.::
17951::$$$message_0135_0004_0005$$$::As you're overcome with grief, Lord Goblin Peyang III appears before you, even though you beat him before!::
17952::$$$message_0135_0004_0006$$$::If you want to fight, go to 14. If you want to turn back, go to 14.::
17953::$$$message_0135_0004_0007$$$::"...[fadebgm time=100 volume=30][se storage=se564.wav]Wha[line len=2]"[fadebgm time=1500 volume=100][lr]::
17954::$$$message_0135_0004_0008$$$::Something is talking directly to my heart.[lr]::
17955::$$$message_0135_0004_0009$$$::Because they're using such archaic language, I wasn't able to tell what they're saying at all...::
17956::$$$message_0135_0005_0000$$$::"W-what the...! This card comes from a game that's endorsed by the Mage's Association, apparently today is the championship match, and the victor can do whatever they want with the whole world...!?"[lr]::
17957::$$$message_0135_0005_0001$$$::I was able to grasp the general outline.::
17958::$$$message_0135_0006_0000$$$::"Ha, ha, ha! Woohoo, kukakakokokokiikii![lr]::
17959::$$$message_0135_0006_0001$$$::Exactly, O chosen red cardmaster! I've been waiting for you, our fated duelist!"::
17960::$$$message_0135_0007_0000$$$::"Who are you...!?"::
17961::$$$message_0135_0008_0000$$$::I can't open my eyes from the strong wind.[lr]::
17962::$$$message_0135_0008_0001$$$::The mysterious person that appeared from the side of the port laughs like a person high on drugs.::
17963::$$$message_0135_0009_0000$$$::"Hahahahahaha![lr]::
17964::$$$message_0135_0009_0001$$$::Who am I? Who am I? Who am I, you said!?[lr]::
17965::$$$message_0135_0009_0002$$$::You don't know, huh! Yeah, you don't know my gorgeous self! Wow, how gross![lr]::
17966::$$$message_0135_0009_0003$$$::Look, Emiya! I'm swimming in so much dark god aura and negative feelings I don't know what to do with it all!"::
17967::$$$message_0135_0010_0000$$$::The turbulent wind, the raging lightning, [se storage=se608.wav]the blue sea that shakes severely.[lr]::
17968::$$$message_0135_0010_0001$$$::[se storage=se023.wav]And the black-tailed gulls that screech overhead.[lr]::
17969::$$$message_0135_0010_0002$$$::A scene that could be considered the end of the world in a variety of ways unfolds unsparingly.[lr]::
17970::$$$message_0135_0010_0003$$$::[se storage=se545.wav]Khh...[se storage=se544.wav]are you saying that even the stars are also shaking violently from this Armageddon that appeared out of nowhere!!!???::
17971::$$$message_0135_0011_0000$$$::"C-Could it be that you're...[wvl][se storage=se023.wav] Shinji [wvl canskip=0 time=500][se storage=se023.wav]Matou...!!!???[lr]::
17972::$$$message_0135_0011_0001$$$::No way, you should be dead!"[lr]::
17973::$$$message_0135_0011_0002$$$::"I'm not dead![lr]::
17974::$$$message_0135_0011_0003$$$::[se storage=se023.wav]Well, character-wise, I'm mostly dead, [wvl][se storage=se545.wav]but that's why I revived from hell, Champion Emiya! ::
17975::$$$message_0135_0011_0004$$$::Koohoohoo, the rage of those who were oppressed revived me. Mm, I want you to see the power boiling within me."::
17976::$$$message_0135_0012_0000$$$::A swirl of magical energy appears that reminds me of Saber.[lr]::
17977::$$$message_0135_0012_0001$$$::J-Just how much power does he have...!!!???::
17978::$$$message_0135_0013_0000$$$::"Wait, [wvl canskip=0 time=500][se storage=se564.wav][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=5]you haven't changed one bit!"[lr]::
17979::$$$message_0135_0013_0001$$$::"Heheheh, I understand how you feel, but I don't want you to be surprised.[lr]::
17980::$$$message_0135_0013_0002$$$::Yes, [wvl][se storage=se023.wav]the me until now was not me![lr]::
17981::$$$message_0135_0013_0003$$$::Umm, if you were to say that the me until now was a seedless watermelon, the me from now is a seedless melon![lr]::
17982::$$$message_0135_0013_0004$$$::No, if I was a caterpillar that was waiting to grow wings back then, now I'm a cocoon after it's shed its skin!"::
17983::$$$message_0135_0014_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17984::$$$message_0135_0014_0001$$$::So is he basically empty inside?[lr]::
17985::$$$message_0135_0014_0002$$$::Also, I want him to at least listen to my reactions.::
17986::$$$message_0135_0015_0000$$$::"Whatever.[lr]::
17987::$$$message_0135_0015_0001$$$::Anyway, we're warriors chosen by the cards, right!? We're fated rivals, right!?[wvl][se storage=se023.wav] I'm going to fight for everyone, while you're going to fight to destroy the world, right!?"::
17988::$$$message_0135_0016_0000$$$::"Nice reaction! You get it, Emiya! You must like this kind of stuff, don't you!?"[lr]::
17989::$$$message_0135_0016_0001$$$::"Yeah! This is getting pretty insane, but I love winning, losing, crying, showing off, and getting canceled after ten [wvl][se storage=se545.wav]episodes![lr]::
17990::$$$message_0135_0016_0002$$$::So, let's go, Shinji...![lr]::
17991::$$$message_0135_0016_0003$$$::I WILL NEVER FORGIVE YOU!!!!!"::
17992::$$$message_0135_0017_0000$$$::"Khh...you sure can howl, protagonist.[lr]::
17993::$$$message_0135_0017_0001$$$::But today, I'm stronger than you. You should realize your rival's awakened powers...![lr]::
17994::$$$message_0135_0017_0002$$$::Here I go, Emiya![lr]::
17995::$$$message_0135_0017_0003$$$::I'll place this card face down, and end my turn...!!!"[wvs][se storage=se023.wav]::
17996::$$$message_0135_0019_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
17997::$$$message_0135_0019_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
17998::$$$message_0135_0019_0002$$$::The storm passes.[lr]::
17999::$$$message_0135_0019_0003$$$::The weird hot air [se volume=70 storage=se545.wav]that was swirling disappears, and we become awfully calm.[sestop storage=se544.wav time=3000 nowait=true]::
18000::$$$message_0135_0020_0000$$$::"Well, I'm going back to my usual spot."[lr]::
18001::$$$message_0135_0020_0001$$$::I just nod in response.[lr]::
18002::$$$message_0135_0020_0002$$$::There are times when you shouldn't say anything to men.::
18003::$$$message_0135_0021_0000$$$::"I'll give this to you then. Please feel free to play from the Special menu when you feel like it."[lr]::
18004::$$$message_0135_0021_0001$$$::Shinji cheerfully goes to the side of the port.[lr]::
18005::$$$message_0135_0021_0002$$$::Oh, he put a cardboard box over his head.::
18006::$$$message_0135_0022_0000$$$::"...[se volume=60 storage=se544.wav]...[say storage=cty0431_shi_0140 name=士郎]I guess I should head home, too."[lr]::
18007::$$$message_0135_0022_0001$$$::I erase the last thirty minutes from my memory and leave the port.::
18008::$$$message_0135_0023_0000$$$::As such, I was able to save the earth from destruction by Shinji-Oh, but his biggest performance and the story of the hero that prevented his plan would be forgotten, never to be spoken of again. The end.::
917994::$$$message_9135_0017_0002$$$::"Here I go, Emiya! I'll place this card face down, and end my turn...!!!"[r]!